{"id":"b8","level":3,"levelName":"Ulpan Bet","n":8,"of":9,"title":"The second binyan","titleHe":"בִּנְיַן פִּעֵל","goal":"Recognise and use pi'el, the pattern with a doubled middle letter.","sections":[{"type":"text","body":"Every Hebrew verb belongs to a binyan — a pattern the three root letters are poured into. You've been using פָּעַל all along. פִּעֵל is the second, and you can spot it: the present tense starts with מְ, and the middle root letter carries a dagesh."},{"type":"binyan","he":"פִּעֵל","en":"pi'el","note":"Often an intensified or causative sense; the middle root letter doubles.","verb":{"root":"ד־ב־ר","inf":"לְדַבֵּר","en":"to speak"},"tense":"present","rows":[{"label":"masculine singular","he":"","form":"מְדַבֵּר"},{"label":"feminine singular","he":"","form":"מְדַבֶּרֶת"},{"label":"masculine plural","he":"","form":"מְדַבְּרִים"},{"label":"feminine plural","he":"","form":"מְדַבְּרוֹת"}]},{"type":"binyan","he":"פִּעֵל","en":"pi'el","note":"Often an intensified or causative sense; the middle root letter doubles.","verb":{"root":"ד־ב־ר","inf":"לְדַבֵּר","en":"to speak"},"tense":"past","rows":[{"label":"I","he":"אֲנִי","form":"דִּבַּרְתִּי"},{"label":"you (m.)","he":"אַתָּה","form":"דִּבַּרְתָּ"},{"label":"you (f.)","he":"אַתְּ","form":"דִּבַּרְתְּ"},{"label":"he","he":"הוּא","form":"דִּבֵּר"},{"label":"she","he":"הִיא","form":"דִּבְּרָה"},{"label":"we","he":"אֲנַחְנוּ","form":"דִּבַּרְנוּ"},{"label":"you (m.pl.)","he":"אַתֶּם","form":"דִּבַּרְתֶּם"},{"label":"you (f.pl.)","he":"אַתֶּן","form":"דִּבַּרְתֶּן"},{"label":"they","he":"הֵם / הֵן","form":"דִּבְּרוּ"}]},{"type":"tip","body":"Same root, different binyan, different meaning. From ל־מ־ד: לוֹמֵד in pa'al is learns, מְלַמֵּד in pi'el is teaches — makes someone learn."}],"vocab":[{"he":"מְדַבֵּר","en":"speaks","translit":"medaber"},{"he":"מְלַמֵּד","en":"teaches","translit":"melamed"},{"he":"מְסַפֵּר","en":"tells","translit":"mesaper"},{"he":"מְבַקֵּשׁ","en":"asks for","translit":"mevakesh"},{"he":"מְקַבֵּל","en":"receives, gets","translit":"mekabel"},{"he":"מְשַׂחֵק","en":"plays","translit":"mesachek"},{"he":"מְטַיֵּל","en":"travels, strolls","translit":"metayel"}],"exercises":[{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["give! (m.)","the book","speaks","his house"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מְדַבֵּר","translit":"medaber"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["spoken of, in question","it's possible","slowly","teaches"],"correct":3,"prompt":"מְלַמֵּד","translit":"melamed"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["beginning","said","tells","heart (poetic)"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מְסַפֵּר","translit":"mesaper"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["to go","beginning","asks for","children"],"correct":2,"prompt":"מְבַקֵּשׁ","translit":"mevakesh"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["not yet","sentence","roof","receives, gets"],"correct":3,"prompt":"מְקַבֵּל","translit":"mekabel"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["house","boy","land, country","plays"],"correct":3,"prompt":"מְשַׂחֵק","translit":"mesachek"},{"type":"choice","q":"What does this mean?","options":["travels, strolls","hospital","was (f.)","me"],"correct":0,"prompt":"מְטַיֵּל","translit":"metayel"},{"type":"choice","q":"speak — masculine plural, present","options":["מְדַבֵּר","מְדַבֶּרֶת","מְדַבְּרוֹת","מְדַבְּרִים"],"correct":3,"he":true,"why":"פִּעֵל, present: masculine plural is מְדַבְּרִים."},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “speaks”?","options":["תּוֹדָה","הַכֹּל","מְדַבֵּר","מִשְׁפָּט"],"correct":2,"he":true},{"type":"read","he":"מְטַיֵּל","translit":"metayel","en":"travels, strolls"},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “receives, gets”?","options":["מְקַבֵּל","שֻׁלְחָן","אִישׁ","דִּבּוּר"],"correct":0,"he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"speak — masculine singular, present","options":["מְדַבֶּרֶת","מְדַבֵּר","מְדַבְּרִים","מְדַבְּרוֹת"],"correct":1,"he":true,"why":"פִּעֵל, present: masculine singular is מְדַבֵּר."},{"type":"listen","q":"Which word did you hear?","options":["מְדַבֵּר","מְבַקֵּשׁ","מְסַפֵּר","מְשַׂחֵק"],"correct":2,"say":"מְסַפֵּר","he":true},{"type":"choice","q":"speak — feminine singular, present","options":["מְדַבֵּר","מְדַבְּרִים","מְדַבֶּרֶת","מְדַבְּרוֹת"],"correct":2,"he":true,"why":"פִּעֵל, present: feminine singular is מְדַבֶּרֶת."},{"type":"match","pairs":[["מְלַמֵּד","teaches"],["מְשַׂחֵק","plays"],["מְסַפֵּר","tells"],["מְדַבֵּר","speaks"],["מְבַקֵּשׁ","asks for"]]},{"type":"choice","q":"How do you say “tells”?","options":["נָכוֹן","מִסְפָּר","מַיִם","מְסַפֵּר"],"correct":3,"he":true}]}